+/* The engine's present into the window: the frame's batch (its draws, the blit onto the display image and the
+ * centre-pixel copy) is submitted as it is, the blit into the acquired swapchain image goes in a second command buffer
+ * that waits for the acquire, and one fence wait covers both. It used to be three submissions and three waits a
+ * frame, one of them a full-frame readback only the debug hooks read. */
+static VkCommandBuffer s_cmd_win;
